  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A pet: base animal makes it an animal that can be tamed and bred. msm:tameable tames it one time in three when a player feeds it berries (minecraft:sweet_berries, minecraft:glow_berries): then it follows its owner, sits or stands when the owner right-clicks it with an empty hand and attacks what hurts its owner or what its owner attacks (melee_attack, 3 damage), never despawns and has 20 health instead of 10. msm:breedable lets two tamed or wild pets fed cooked meat have a baby at half size that grows up in 20 minutes; the food also tempts it. It spawns in every forest in groups of two to four (rule animal: on grass in daylight). msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto: GeckoLib draws it where the target has GeckoLib, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game."
